
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Silent Ink | A Home for Words</title>

<style>
:root {
  --bg: #F8F3EB;
  --brown: #725F50;
  --text: #51463E;
  --border: #A89985;
  --light: #EDE4D8;
}

* {
  margin: 0;
  padding: 0;
  box-sizing: border-box;
  scroll-behavior: smooth;
}

body {
  background: var(--bg);
  color: var(--text);
  font-family: Georgia, serif;
  line-height: 1.8;
}

nav {
  display: flex;
  justify-content: space-between;
  align-items: center;
  padding: 22px 8%;
  border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
}

.logo {
  font-size: 25px;
  letter-spacing: 2px;
  color: var(--brown);
}

nav a {
  color: var(--text);
  text-decoration: none;
  margin-left: 22px;
  font-size: 14px;
}

.hero {
  min-height: 75vh;
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  justify-content: center;
  align-items: center;
  text-align: center;
  padding: 70px 20px;
}

.hero h1 {
  font-size: clamp(55px, 9vw, 100px);
  font-weight: normal;
  color: var(--brown);
  letter-spacing: 3px;
}

.hero p {
  font-size: 19px;
  font-style: italic;
  margin-top: 12px;
}

.hero .intro {
  max-width: 550px;
  margin-top: 30px;
  font-style: normal;
  font-size: 16px;
}

.line {
  width: 65px;
  border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
  margin: 28px auto;
}

section {
  padding: 85px 10%;
  text-align: center;
}

.section-title {
  font-size: 38px;
  font-weight: normal;
  color: var(--brown);
  margin-bottom: 18px;
}

.about p {
  max-width: 680px;
  margin: auto;
  font-size: 17px;
}

.poetry-card {
  max-width: 650px;
  margin: 35px auto;
  padding: 38px 25px;
  border: 1px solid var(--border);
  background: rgba(255,255,255,0.25);
}

.poetry-card h3 {
  font-size: 28px;
  font-weight: normal;
  color: var(--brown);
}

.poetry-card p {
  margin: 15px 0;
  font-style: italic;
}

.poetry-card a {
  display: inline-block;
  margin-top: 15px;
  color: var(--brown);
  text-decoration: none;
  border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
}

.poem {
  white-space: pre-line;
  font-size: 17px;
  line-height: 2;
  margin-top: 25px;
}

.collections {
  background: var(--light);
}

.collection-grid {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(180px, 1fr));
  gap: 20px;
  margin-top: 35px;
}

.collection {
  padding: 30px 15px;
  border: 1px solid var(--border);
  font-size: 19px;
  color: var(--brown);
}

.contact p {
  font-style: italic;
}

footer {
  text-align: center;
  padding: 30px 15px;
  border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
  font-size: 14px;
  color: var(--brown);
}

@media(max-width: 600px) {
  nav {
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 12px;
  }
  nav a {
    margin: 0 8px;
  }
  section {
    padding: 65px 7%;
  }
}
</style>
</head>

<body>

<nav>
  <div class="logo">Silent Ink</div>
  <div>
    <a href="#home">Home</a>
    <a href="#about">About</a>
    <a href="#poetry">Poetry</a>
    <a href="#contact">Contact</a>
  </div>
</nav>

<header class="hero" id="home">
  <h1>Silent Ink</h1>
  <div class="line"></div>
  <p>Some feelings are better written than spoken.</p>
  <p class="intro">
    Welcome to a little corner of words, emotions,
    unspoken thoughts and stories that live between the lines.
  </p>
</header>

<section class="about" id="about">
  <h2 class="section-title">Behind the Ink</h2>
  <div class="line"></div>
  <p>
    Silent Ink is a collection of thoughts, emotions and
    little pieces of life written into words.
    A space where feelings find their voice and
    ordinary moments become poetry.
  </p>
</section>

<section id="poetry">
  <h2 class="section-title">My Poetry</h2>
  <div class="line"></div>
  <p>Every poem holds a story. Here are a few pages from mine.</p>

  <article class="poetry-card">
    <h3>She Stood</h3>
    <p>A poem about quiet strength and resilience.</p>
    <a href="#she-stood">Read the poem →</a>
  </article>

  <article class="poetry-card" id="she-stood">
    <h3>She Stood</h3>
    <p class="poem">She was a girl with a thousand problems,
never knowing whom to turn to for help.
Though she never really wanted to be rescued,
because she was a girl with a spine.

She knew, even at her lowest,
how much disrespect and neglect she had endured
from those she once considered the closest.
Every night, she fell apart,
yet every morning,
she chose to rise with strength.

She was broken by so many,
yet never truly loved by anyone.

Perhaps, a part of her lives in every girl
who stands as a fighter today,
but was once made to feel like a loser.</p>
    <p>— Silent Ink</p>
  </article>
</section>

<section class="collections">
  <h2 class="section-title">Collections</h2>
  <div class="line"></div>
  <div class="collection-grid">
    <div class="collection">Love & Longing</div>
    <div class="collection">Life & Reflections</div>
    <div class="collection">Girlhood</div>
    <div class="collection">Unspoken Words</div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="contact" id="contact">
  <h2 class="section-title">Stay Connected</h2>
  <div class="line"></div>
  <p>Thank you for reading between the lines.</p>
  <p>With words, always.</p>
  <p>— Silent Ink</p>
</section>

<footer>
  © 2026 Silent Ink. All rights reserved.
</footer>

</body>
</html>
